ses. &nbsp; o Experience testing Oracle Fusion quarterly releases and regression cycles. &nbsp; o Understanding of Oracle Fusion security roles, workflows, and business processes. &nbsp; o Experience designing automation solutions for Oracle Fusion HCM applications. 

